cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Crop Classification with Deep Learning"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Osman"
    alias: "Osman-Geomatics93"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Osman-Geomatics93/crop-classification-deep-learning"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - crop-classification
  - deep-learning
  - remote-sensing
  - sentinel-2
  - pytorch
  - machine-learning
  - google-earth-engine
  - xgboost
  - random-forest
  - geospatial
abstract: >-
  Multi-class crop classification pipeline for the Elgabel Region, Sudan
  using Sentinel-2 satellite imagery. Implements scikit-learn models
  (MLP, XGBoost, Random Forest) and PyTorch deep learning architectures
  (SpectralMLP, SpectralCNN1D, SpectralHybrid, SpectralAttention) with
  FocalLoss, SMOTE, and class weighting for imbalanced data.
